Package: clingo-dl
Architecture: any
Section: devel
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}, libclingo-dl (= ${binary:Version})
Description: A solver for logic programs with finite domain constraints
 Clingcon is an extension of the clingo Answer Set Programming (ASP) system
 that integrates finite domain constraint solving. It enables modeling and
 solving problems with variables over finite domains and complex constraints,
 making it suitable for applications such as resource allocation and planning.

